# Dependencias (NUNCA deben subirse a Git)
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Variables de entorno y credenciales
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Laravel Cache y Storage
**/storage/logs/*.log
**/storage/framework/cache/data/*
**/storage/framework/sessions/*
**/storage/framework/views/*
**/storage/framework/testing/*
